   that depend on choice of State class into SweepTmpl or a subclass
   thereof.  Requires going through all member functions, one by one
   for both Rp and R1d namespaces.

2) Add Sweep as a parameter and base class for SweepTmpl, and reverse
   order of inheritances (Sweep becones a base of SweepTnpl, rather
   than the reverse).

3) Reimplement state extrapolation using vecOp funtions for states.

